<!--
  LieppOS C48 PUBLICATION CANDIDATE - NOT ACTIVE.

  This file is not included by default.xml and must not be used as a remotely
  syncable manifest until every revision below has been published and verified
  reachable from GitHub, and the owner has approved the exact transaction.

  The kernel snapshot and both module mirrors are PARTIAL:
    - the proprietary FPSGO private wrapper is excluded;
    - four Ulefone board drivers that embed vendor firmware, logo or
      calibration images are withheld pending a redistribution review.
  The candidate therefore describes a source-coherent core build, not complete
  device support. See docs/integration/C48-MANIFEST-PUBLICATION-PLAN.md in the
  LieppOS workspace.

  Project paths are disjoint. No GKI source is checked out twice.

  C49 correction: the three kernel/module pins are reachable on the remote
  publication/c48 branches (verified with git ls-remote); remote main branches
  do not exist, so upstream="publication/c48" is recorded. The fetch URL now
  uses the ssh://host/path form used by default.xml.
-->
